# The repository already stores every text file with LF. Saying so explicitly
# keeps the working copy on LF as well, so a checkout on Windows does not hand
# CRLF to editors and tools that then write it back into a diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Always-binary fixtures. PLY and STL are deliberately absent: those formats
# have both an ASCII and a binary flavour, and the ASCII fixtures are text that
# must stay normalized. Git's content heuristic already leaves the binary ones
# alone.
*.drc binary
*.glb binary
*.bin binary
*.fbx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
